<http://data.silknow.org/object/4f18ad8d-7e3f-3349-b4b5-9ba7b62ab972>
        a                   ecrm:E73_Information_Object ;
        rdfs:comment        "This embroidery belongs to Group 3 as defined by Jennifer Wearden, 'Azerbaijan Embroideries: A Synthesis of Contrasts', <i>Hali</i> 59 (October 1991) pp.102-111. Group 3 textiles are characterised by  surface darning on the diagonal, usually in pale shades."@en ;
