        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/information/bibliography> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "This embroidery belongs to Group 3 as defined by Jennifer Wearden, 'Azerbaijan Embroideries: A Synthesis of Contrasts', <i>Hali</i> 59 (October 1991) pp.102-111. Group 3 textiles are characterised by  surface darning on the diagonal, usually in pale shades."@en .

